<Events>
    <!--Campaign: Amthor. Created by Sil taTener-->
	<Warlord side="1" name="Silanda" city="Skyvine" level="10" portrait="12" major="3" minor="3">
		<Unit id="0" type="55" level="4" name="Ulhnga"/>
		<Unit id="1" type="56" level="6" name="Thanior"/>
		<Unit id="2" type="57" level="7" name="Blakur"/>
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="2" name="Thurna" city="Myrryn" level="7" portrait="21" major="3" minor="1">
	</Warlord>


	<Warlord side="3" name="Karlout" city="Starhaven" level="8" portrait="11" major="1" minor="0">
		<Unit id="0" type="5" level="5" name="Kharal"/>
		<Unit id="1" type="5" level="7" name="Thoran"/>
		<Unit id="2" type="4" level="6" name="Siltro"/>
	</Warlord>

	<Warlord side="4" name="Draknor" city="Khaz-Dhorlikh" level="12" portrait="08" major="2" minor="1">
	</Warlord>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1">
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="1"/>
		<Message>巩固军队的补给之后，你开始筹划进攻卡兹·阿加尔。|斥候报告说，|阿格诺里尔王子已成为卡兹·阿加尔的新国王，|身边还召集了两名强大的元素生物。|传言这对元素双子无坚不摧。|你必须先查清关于元素双子的古老传说。贸然进攻只会招致毁灭。你强压怒火，命令部队前往西北方精灵的天藤城。那座传说中的图书馆里，想必存有记载此事的古书。只是精灵绝不会自愿接纳一名矮人的后裔。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="eq1"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="war1"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="0" String1="war2"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1">
		<Trigger type="turn" data1="3"/>
		<Message>斥候报告，|卡兹·阿加尔和希里亚骑士团的部队正在西方集结。|小心别被夹在两条战线之间。</Message>
	</Event>

    <!--Elementar Quest City Skyvine-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="1">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
		<Message>你终于进入天藤城的图书馆。|斥候找到一本记载元素双子传说的书，|可惜它使用古精灵语写成。也许希安特拉能够翻译。|接下来进入《阿姆索尔 04》。</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="1">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>你终于进入天藤城的图书馆。|斥候找到一本记载元素双子传说的书，|可惜它使用古精灵语写成。也许希安特拉能够翻译。|你派出使者去找她。</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>


	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="1">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>你终于进入天藤城的图书馆，|却没有找到记载那段传说的书。|斥候报告说，一名执政天使已逃向茫茫大海。</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>


    <!--Elementar Quest City Myrryn-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="0"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
		<Message>你终于进入米林的图书馆。|斥候找到一本记载元素双子传说的书，|可惜它使用古精灵语写成。也许希安特拉能够翻译。|接下来进入《阿姆索尔 04》。</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="0"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>你终于进入米林的图书馆。|斥候找到一本记载元素双子传说的书，|可惜它使用古精灵语写成。也许希安特拉能够翻译。|你派出使者去找她。</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>


	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="0">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="0"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>你进入米林的图书馆，却没有找到记载那段传说的书。|只有天藤城的图书馆收藏着关于元素双子的古书。</Message>
		<Action type="particle" string1="QuestSparkle"/>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="eq1"/>
	</Event>

    <!--Warlords quest Dwarves-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="3">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="3"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>你杀死了矮人首领，击退了追兵。|接下来进入《阿姆索尔 04》。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="3">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="3"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ne" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>你杀死了矮人首领，击退了追兵。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="3">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="3"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="war2"/>
		<Message>你杀死了矮人首领。追击你的敌军势必受到重创。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
	</Event>

    <!--Warlords quest Knights-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="31">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="31"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>你杀死了骑士团首领，击退了追兵。|接下来进入《阿姆索尔 04》。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="31">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="31"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_ne" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>你杀死了骑士团首领，击退了追兵。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
	</Event>

	<Event side="0" repeat="1" location="city" locdata="31">
		<Trigger type="on_city"/>
		<Trigger type="city_won" data1="31"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="0" String1="war1"/>
		<Message>你杀死了骑士团首领。追击你的敌军势必受到重创。</Message>
		<Action type="counter_set" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
	</Event>

    <!--Win Option-->
	<Event side="0" repeat="99" location="city" locdata="5">
		<Trigger type="on_turn"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war1"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="1" String1="war2"/>
		<Trigger type="counter_eq" data1="2" String1="eq1"/>
		<Message>接下来进入《阿姆索尔 04》。</Message>
		<Action type="victory" data1="0"/>
	</Event>

</Events>
